{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "label": "pipeTo", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Plant einen Callback auf dem Promise, der das Ergebnis dem Empfaenger tellt - Fulfillment als Success, Rejection als Failure. Die Mailbox bleibt unblockiert; das Ergebnis landet als normale Nachricht in Reihenfolge mit allem anderen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_after", "label": "after", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "setTimeout + Promise statt blockierendem sleep; die Factory laeuft genau einmal nach dem Delay. after(0, factory) defered immer noch ueber die Event-Loop - nuetzlich fuer Yield-and-Resume, aber langsamer als der direkte Aufruf.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_success", "label": "Success<T>", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Getaggte, nach der Konstruktion unveraenderliche Envelope-Klasse. Verhindert, dass rohe Promise-Ergebnisse versehentlich als Commands behandelt werden; Pattern-Match via instanceof oder P.instanceOf.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_failure", "label": "Failure", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": null, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipetooptions", "label": "PipeToOptions (wrap, sender)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "wrap: false tellt den rohen Fulfillment-Wert und verwirft Rejections still - fuer Targets, die die rohe Form erwarten, oder wenn Fehler anderswo behandelt werden. sender schreibt die Nachricht einem spezifischen Actor zu.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_cancellablepromise", "label": "CancellablePromise<T>", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "cancel() cleared den Timer und rejected das Promise mit Error('after: cancelled') - Basis fuer Watchdog-/Timeout-Abort-Logik via Promise.race.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_await_in_onreceive", "label": "await innerhalb von onReceive blockiert die Mailbox", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Die Per-Message-Garantie laesst nur einen onReceive-Aufruf gleichzeitig laufen; ein await haelt den Aufruf am Leben, bis das Promise settled, sodass die naechste Nachricht wartet. Bei schnellem, zuverlaessigem Downstream okay - bei langsamem oder flakey stapelt sich die Mailbox.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_mdc_boundary", "label": "pipeTo traegt MDC nicht ueber die Grenze", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Das Promise resolved ausserhalb eines LogContext.run-Scopes, das folgende tell traegt also moeglicherweise nicht die urspruengliche MDC. Workaround: LogContext.snapshot() nehmen und das Promise wickeln. Als v1-raue Kante markiert, mit tracing-bewusstem pipeTo auf der Roadmap.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_timers_comparison", "label": "context.timers vs. after", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "context.timers liefert via tell an self, wird beim Actor-Stop automatisch gecancelt und ist fuer actor-internes Scheduling gedacht; after resolved ein Promise, cancelt manuell und ist die Bruecke zwischen Actor und Promise-Pipeline.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_success", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_failure", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipetooptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_after", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_cancellablepromise", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_await_in_onreceive", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_mdc_boundary", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_after", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_timers_comparison", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_after", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_pipeto", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/futures-patterns.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}